{
    "id":  3419,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED module - 15W - GU10 / MR16 for Ring Downlight - CRI+92 - UGR13",
    "reference":  "15WUGR13-90926-3K",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe 15W MR16 / GU10 LED Module for Downlights is a product that allows to replace GU10 or MR16 Bulbs with a high power LED Module and external driver. Output of \u003cstrong\u003e130Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e. High colour rendering index \u003cstrong\u003e+92\u003c/strong\u003e - PROFESSIONAL COLOUR - for quality light and real, professional colours. It has a \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u0026lt;13\u003c/strong\u003e which means that it will be difficult to enter the area where it can dazzle us. \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED module - 15W - GU10 / MR16 for Ring Downlight - CRI+92\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur LED Module can be installed in false ceilings as a GU10 / MR16 dichroic bulb.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur module incorporates an external driver that \u003cstrong\u003eallows the LED to work at higher powers\u003c/strong\u003e, extends the life and increases the light output of the LED diode, as the heat generated by the driver does not interfere with the diode, thus increasing the life of the luminaire as a whole.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA ring is required as an accessory for the correct installation of the product.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe beam of light is of high quality due to its high \u003cstrong\u003eCRI+92\u003c/strong\u003e, and its primary angle of\u003cstrong\u003e 36º\u003c/strong\u003e, which gives us the possibility of highlighting specific elements of a room; at the same time it provides us with significant savings in electricity consumption.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of LED module - 15W - GU10 / MR16 for Ring Downlight - CRI+92:\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBathrooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWardrobes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBedrooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShowcases\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShop windows\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCorridors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial premises\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Empotrable-LED-7W-Cuadrado.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy this product with 3 Years Guarantee in our online shop FactorLED.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
